WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:03.999
All right, I want to tell you guys about something
that's been sort of going on behind the scenes

00:00:03.999 --> 00:00:09.450
at the show, and maybe it'll be interesting
to you and it has everything to do with people

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:15.590
in my audience who are never going to be satisfied
with this program for lack of a better term

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:19.500
and maybe naively over the last few months.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.890
Maybe I thought that I could satisfy them
in some way.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:26.510
And this doesn't apply to everybody.

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:29.850
But there are also people in the audience
that probably I should sort of be apologizing

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:35.090
to in the sense that I think that my naivete
on this issue may have made the show worse

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:37.610
for some of you over the last few months.

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:43.430
And here is the realization that we've sort
of come to as as a as a point of departure

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.470
for what we're talking about today.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:51.170
It's become very clear over the last, I would
say acutely the last three months, but more

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:56.340
bigger picture over the last year that there's
a slice of the left that's never going to

00:00:56.340 --> 00:01:01.289
be satisfied with this program unless I just
become a different person with totally different

00:01:01.289 --> 00:01:05.420
views and a different moral grounding and
essentially am no longer me.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:07.749
And the show is no longer this program.

00:01:07.749 --> 00:01:13.139
Now, of course, the entire right is dissatisfied
with this program other than the people who

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:17.579
write to me and say, I don't agree with anything
you say, but I just I watch to see what your

00:01:17.579 --> 00:01:18.579
take is.

00:01:18.579 --> 00:01:19.719
And I appreciate you being honest about it.

00:01:19.719 --> 00:01:23.789
But in terms of the positions I take, of course,
the right doesn't agree with almost anything

00:01:23.789 --> 00:01:25.649
that I say on this program.

00:01:25.649 --> 00:01:30.329
But there is also a contingent on the left,
which is far louder in the sense in a sense,

00:01:30.329 --> 00:01:37.679
because they are at least, you know, nominally
part of my side as the term is.

00:01:37.679 --> 00:01:41.499
That is never going to be satisfied with this
program unless I just abandon everything I

00:01:41.499 --> 00:01:43.479
believe and take their positions.

00:01:43.479 --> 00:01:48.689
So before I get to that, I told this story
years I've been telling the story over the

00:01:48.689 --> 00:01:51.979
years, many times when I started the David
Pakman show.

00:01:51.979 --> 00:01:53.729
Back then, it was called Mid-week Politics.

00:01:53.729 --> 00:01:56.139
It was just a when a Wednesday program.

00:01:56.139 --> 00:02:00.429
I was absolutely horrified that somebody might
write to me and be mad that I said something

00:02:00.429 --> 00:02:04.139
they disagree with or they might leave an
angry YouTube comment or something like that.

00:02:04.139 --> 00:02:06.029
It was scary to me.

00:02:06.029 --> 00:02:10.159
And I sort of tried to play the show down
the middle for a while, for a few weeks where

00:02:10.159 --> 00:02:14.280
I would report the news and I would say the
left says this and the right says this and

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:15.280
kind of leave it there.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.390
And it was a very boring show.

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:21.909
And it was also unsatisfying because, of course,
I had opinions and I was keeping them to myself

00:02:21.909 --> 00:02:24.370
and not really stating them because of this
fear.

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.409
And also people got mad anyway, right?

00:02:26.409 --> 00:02:30.300
People disagreed that there were two sides
to many stories and they were mad that I presented

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:32.230
both sides as if they were equal.

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:35.879
So the point is I quickly realized that that
couldn't be the show.

00:02:35.879 --> 00:02:38.329
It wasn't a satisfying way to me to do the
show.

00:02:38.329 --> 00:02:43.489
And it wasn't very useful either, because
I have an opinion that I want to get out there

00:02:43.489 --> 00:02:47.030
so that this very quickly became an opinion
program.

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:50.190
And of course, now I'm used to the attacks
and the anti-Semitic comments and thousands

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:55.719
of excuse me, angry, angry YouTube comments
a day or whatever the case may be.

00:02:55.719 --> 00:02:59.090
But over the last three to twelve months,
it's become very clear that there is now a

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:06.670
slice of the left that is not going to accept
any position other than their position.

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:11.969
And they won't stop calling me a DNC shill
or other terms unless I take their positions.

00:03:11.969 --> 00:03:15.659
And what I want to tell you today is that
it's not going any further.

00:03:15.659 --> 00:03:17.890
You're not going to be satisfied with this
program.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:19.880
And maybe this isn't the program for you.

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:21.170
Let me give you some examples.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:22.170
OK.

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:24.560
Right now, these are maybe relevant examples.

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:27.439
One is the never Biden crowd, OK?

00:03:27.439 --> 00:03:32.079
The never Biden crowd is never going to be
satisfied with what I say unless I join them

00:03:32.079 --> 00:03:34.590
and say I'm never going to vote for Biden.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.900
Now, I'm not going to do that at this point
based on what we know.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.579
It's conceivable Joe Biden could go on a killing
spree or something.

00:03:40.579 --> 00:03:42.040
And I've changed my mind.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:46.719
But it's become clear that no matter how I
couched the reality, that based on everything

00:03:46.719 --> 00:03:52.040
I know right now, Biden is clearly better
than Trump and I plan to vote for Biden.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:53.830
I could talk about the Supreme Court.

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.030
It doesn't matter.

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:58.549
It doesn't matter what I say unless I refuse
to vote for Biden.

00:03:58.549 --> 00:04:02.779
There's a very loud contingent that shows
up on my Twitter and read it and whatever.

00:04:02.779 --> 00:04:04.180
They're not going to be happy.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.450
Now, the good news is they represent a pretty
small portion of my audience and a pretty

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:10.220
small portion of the left.

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:14.250
But this is not going to be a program for
these folks.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:20.840
And they will call me a Democratic DNC shill
unless I say never Biden, which, of course,

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.819
helps Donald Trump not going to do it.

00:04:22.819 --> 00:04:25.150
Let's talk about another example.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:27.669
This relates to a woman named Tara Reid.

00:04:27.669 --> 00:04:31.770
Tara Reid says Joe Biden sexually assaulted
her in 1993.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:36.169
Now, there was a period of about seven to
10 days where I had a contingent contacting

00:04:36.169 --> 00:04:41.139
me increasingly angrily saying, David, you're
terrible, you're a shill because you're not

00:04:41.139 --> 00:04:42.340
covering her allegation.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:45.889
Now, over time, more and more clips have published
my YouTube channel.

00:04:45.889 --> 00:04:48.250
Now I believe it's six in total were terror.

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.000
Reid's allegations are discussed.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.300
Has this satisfied this slice of the left?

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:57.780
No, course not, because I'm talking about
Tara Reid now, but I'm not saying the right

00:04:57.780 --> 00:04:59.130
thing, which I guess.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:00.720
Is Joe Biden's a rapist?

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:04.470
And I'm not voting for him, but of course
I'm not going to say that Joe Biden hasn't

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:05.470
been convicted of rape.

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:08.200
He's not even accused of rape, if I understand
the allegations correctly.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:13.050
And the reality is that either Joe Biden or
Donald Trump are going to be president of

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:15.560
the United States on dozens of issues.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:16.770
I prefer Biden.

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:20.860
Now, this is not some big theatrical, defiant
performance for me.

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:22.860
I'm living my life.

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:25.229
I'm doing the show and advocating for the
policies I support.

00:05:25.229 --> 00:05:28.860
And in November, I will essentially have two
choices.

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:32.160
And I've made clear as of right now which
choice I'm going to make.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.569
I have not attacked terror, Reid's credibility.

00:05:35.569 --> 00:05:38.020
I've not come out and said her story makes
no sense.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:39.480
I've not done any of those things.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:43.620
But this contingent didn't really want me
to just talk about terror, Reid.

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:46.379
They want me to say never Biden.

00:05:46.379 --> 00:05:50.669
And they won't be satisfied until I say that
this is no way to run a show if I'm going

00:05:50.669 --> 00:05:56.819
to kowtow to these slices of the left that
are hell bent on getting specific statements

00:05:56.819 --> 00:05:57.819
out of me.

00:05:57.819 --> 00:06:03.180
I could do every show about Tara Reid, but
it's not just about covering it.

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:05.110
It's about taking their position.

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:07.900
And if I don't, I'm a DNC shill and a bad
person.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.840
This probably isn't the show for you.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.580
We've seen this in some other cases as well.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:13.260
I won't spend a lot lot of time on these.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:17.470
But when it comes to the Maduro regime in
Venezuela, you know, I've pointed out the

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:19.500
rhetoric that started with Hugo Chavez.

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:22.150
It was very left populist rhetoric.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.950
It became an authoritarian nightmare, a corrupt
judiciary.

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:26.000
It can't be trusted.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.960
The country's resources have been raped and
pillaged by elites to the exclusion of the

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:30.960
majority.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:34.650
And people write to me and say, David, how
dare you support American intervention in

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:36.120
Venezuela?

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.120
And I say, no.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.120
I'm from South America.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:43.159
I'm very well acquainted with the history
of the region, the disasters of American intervention.

00:06:43.159 --> 00:06:45.159
But Chavez was no hero and Maduro is no hero.

00:06:45.159 --> 00:06:48.130
And they've been bad for the country and they
hate it.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:53.470
So it's not really about I support American
intervention, which they know I don't.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.870
It's that I'm not praying at the altar of
Maduro.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.099
They will never be satisfied.

00:06:58.099 --> 00:07:03.889
Recently, George W. Bush came out with this
just milquetoast statement about unity around

00:07:03.889 --> 00:07:05.440
Corona virus.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:08.669
And I said, hey, George W. Bush is a war criminal.

00:07:08.669 --> 00:07:12.139
But compared to Trump, he sounds like a normal
person, not praise of Bush.

00:07:12.139 --> 00:07:14.720
I'm not rehabilitating his image.

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:21.310
And immediately, dozens of comments and hundreds
of Twitter and Facebook posts saying you are

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:24.680
rehabilitating the image of a war criminal.

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:32.590
They will never be satisfied unless I always
say there is no way in which Bush is better

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:33.770
than Trump.

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:37.460
So my renewed effort is and this is my pledge.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:42.389
I don't care about what these people think
and I'm not going to let it dictate the show.

00:07:42.389 --> 00:07:46.479
You can leave me comments on YouTube or tweet
me, write me e-mail, you know, whatever.

00:07:46.479 --> 00:07:48.509
Maybe this just isn't the show for you.

00:07:48.509 --> 00:07:53.100
Like, I don't watch political shows like mine.

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:56.180
But there must be some show that takes these
positions, right?

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:59.030
Like if you're looking for a never Biden show.

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:00.030
Is there a bite?

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.030
Never.

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:02.030
Biden show out there.

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:03.030
I assume there is.

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:08.000
Or if you're looking for a We love Maduro
show or I'm guessing that these shows exist

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:12.169
much like I can't open the eyes of a devout
trombonist.

00:08:12.169 --> 00:08:13.840
They're closed off.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.930
So are these leftists on this slice of the
left.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.750
And it's sad, but I can't control it.

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:21.350
All I can control is my show.

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:26.750
And I apologize that over the last three months
there's been a naive it.A where I thought

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:29.669
maybe there would be some way.

00:08:29.669 --> 00:08:30.759
It doesn't seem like there is.

00:08:30.759 --> 00:08:32.410
They're not going to be satisfied.

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:36.740
Everybody should watch the shows they want,
read what you want, come to your conclusion,

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:37.740
conclusions.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.320
But we're gonna do the show this way.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:41.580
And that's the way it's going to be.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.240
Now let's get to something positive, which
relates to really great changes for the show.

00:08:45.240 --> 00:09:56.980
That's the next thing.

